OL,3,GNEWSACity to honour fallen at
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are expected to
OL,7,Fline the streets of Worcester for the
OL,8,Fcity's annual Remembrance Sunday
OL,9,Fparade.
OL,11,FVeterans, serving members of the armed
OL,12,Fforces and cadets will march through
OL,13,Fthe city to Worcester Cathedral on 8
OL,14,FNovember for the annual Service of
OL,15,FRemembrance.
OL,17,FThe parade will leave Cornmarket at
OL,18,F09:15 GMT and travel via Mealcheapen
OL,19,FStreet, St Swithun's Street and High
OL,20,FStreet, before arriving at the
OL,21,Fcathedral.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
