OL,3,GNEWSACity to honour fallen at
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA civic procession, led by the Mayor of
OL,7,FWorcester and the Lord Lieutenant of
OL,8,FWorcestershire, will leave the
OL,9,FGuildhall at 09:40 GMT and head to the
OL,10,Fcathedral ahead of the 10:00 service.
